#: preferences.py:646
msgid "Reapply emulation whenever Blender is restarted and after a new file is loaded.\nThis ensures that other add-on's keyboard shortcuts are reliably remapped.\n\nRemapped shortcuts are tracked to avoid remapping the same shortcut twice"
msgstr "每当 Blender 重启以及加载新文件后重新应用模拟。\n这能确保其他插件的键盘快捷键也能可靠地重新映射。\n\n已重新映射的快捷键会被跟踪，以避免对同一快捷键重复映射"

