#: preferences.py:545
msgid "Target Keyboard Layout.\nMost users will only ever need to set this to QWERTY.\n\nOnly specify a different value if you want to adapt your input keyboard layout to a keymap preset that was designed for a distinct, non-QWERTY, keyboard layout.\n\nBy default, editing the target layout is restricted to make the UI easier to understand for new users. Open the preferences (top right corner) if you really need a non-QWERTY target keyboad layout"
msgstr "目标键盘布局。\n大多数用户只需将其设为 QWERTY。\n\n仅当你希望将输入键盘布局适配到为其他非 QWERTY 键盘布局设计的键位映射预设时，才需要指定不同的值。\n\n默认情况下，目标布局的编辑受到限制，以便新手更容易理解界面。如果你确实需要非 QWERTY 的目标键盘布局，请打开偏好设置（右上角）"

#: operators.py:127
msgid "Template"
